title: The Septuagint Myth – Debunking the 2nd Century BC Narrative
description: Against the traditional account of a 2nd-century BC Septuagint: the Letter of Aristeas, the scant manuscript evidence, Hebrew primacy in the NT era, almah, the 4th-century revision and the unreliable minority texts, with objections answered.
